# ===== HISTOIRE 14 — JUNGLE (Londres, ~1993, Goldie / hardcore) =====
# L'amen break découpé à toute vitesse (sous-séquences []), une sub-basse ragga,
# en demi-temps. La virtuosité du breakbeat poussée à l'extrême.
title:  Jungle
bpm:    160
key:    e minor
duck:   30
scene:  matrix
song:   intro*2 main*12 out*2
break:  1 . [2 2] 3 1 . 2 [3 3] 1 . [2 1] 3 1 2 [3 1] . | sample amen | gain 0.3 | in main out
break2@main: {1 2 3}*2 . 1 . [2 3] . 1 . | sample amencut | redux 4 | gain 0.2
sub:    1 . . . . . . . 5, . . . 6, . . . | sine | oct 1 | sub 0.6 | env 0.005 0.2 0.3 0.2 | gain 0.3 | in main out
reese:  1 . . . . . . . 5, . . . 6, . . . | saw | unison 3 | detune 20 | lp 700 | drive 0.3 | oct 2 | gain 0.1 | in main
stab@main: . . Em . . . . . . . G . . . . . | saw | unison 3 | lp 1800 | env 0.01 0.1 0.2 0.2 | reverb 0.3 | gain 0.08
